WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.100
Today is the day. You've done the hard part. A few final reminders before you

2
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:05.440
head in.

3
00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:10.280
Stop all clear liquids at least four hours before your procedure time. Nothing

4
00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:12.560
to drink after that point, including water.

5
00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:16.240
Continue to avoid solid foods and alcohol.

6
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:22.470
Avoid hard candy, gum, and mints. These count as food and can affect your

7
00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:22.800
sedation.

8
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.960
Take a moment to confirm that your output has been running clear.

9
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.680
That's the sign that your prep has done its job. If you're not there yet,

10
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.400
please contact your doctor's office before coming in.

11
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:40.260
Lastly, your driver should also be ready to go. Your doctor is looking forward

12
00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.800
to seeing you and taking great care of you today.
